ively getting to see the flop for free.\n\nReason: There is no value in folding when you can check for free. Raising would bloat the pot while you are likely out of position post-flop with a weak hand. The best strategy is to check, keep the pot small, and hope to hit a strong draw or two pair on the flop.\n\nAnswer: 0'}
